<header><p class="enc-kicker">State</p><h1 class="enc-title">Kingdom of Sine</h1><p class="enc-meta">Also known as Sine</p></header>
<div class="enc-body"><p class="enc-desc">The Kingdom of Sine was a <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/serer">Serer</a> kingdom in present-day <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/senegal">Senegal</a>, located in the region dominated by the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/jolof-empire">Jolof Empire</a>. It was among the polities associated with the Jolof confederation in its early period. Sine retained its own monarchy and identity over a long period and survived as a kingdom into the colonial era.</p><figure class="enc-fig"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/kingdom-of-sine.jpg" alt="Kingdom of Sine" width="320" height="219" fetchpriority="high"><figcaption>Image: HetmanTheResearcher · CC BY 4.0 · <a href="https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Kingdom_of_Sine_Map.png" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Wikimedia Commons</a></figcaption></figure></div>
